  "historyNote": "#4518, eff 10-28-88; EXPIRED 10-28-94 New. #6226, eff 4-24-96; ss by #7489, eff 5-11-01; ss by #7774, eff 10-8-02; ss by #8580, eff 3-11-06; ss by #9556, eff 10-1-09; ss by #10583, eff 10-1-14; ss by #11003, eff 12-23-15; ss by #12858, eff 8-23-19",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
